# Byte-for-byte reproducible artifacts.
#
# `client.js` is committed and `test/build-fresh.test.mjs` compares it byte for
# byte against a fresh build. Git's line-ending conversion would rewrite it to
# CRLF on a Windows clone, so the comparison failed on every fresh checkout even
# though the committed blob was correct. Pin LF for text, and mark binaries so
# nothing tries to "fix" them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.zst binary
*.tgz binary
